        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Experience an unforgettable night of Spanish guitar and Mediterranean music with world-renowned artists Benise and Pavlo. From fiery rhythms to romantic classics like “Hotel California” and “Moonlight Sonata,” this live concert blends Latin, flamenco, and global influences. Benise, the Emmy Award-wi"
